knowledge/atoms/

# Card library (knowledge/*.md): verified genuinely paraphrased (spot-checked against source,
# zero verbatim 8-word overlaps), so this is NOT a copyright-safety exclusion. It's excluded
# because the current 9 skills route through search_atoms.py -> knowledge/atoms/ instead, not
# this card library, so shipping it publicly would just be giving away the curated distillation
# for free with no product reason to. Kept local; revisit if you want it public as documentation.
knowledge/*.md
!knowledge/_README.md
!knowledge/_taxonomy.md

